<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζεστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seethed, boiled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα ζ. καὶ ὀπτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Hisp.</u>
					85
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					70.11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.50
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα ζ</span>., of hot springs,
				<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				12.8.17
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλιαρός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.101
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάμμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					6.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ δὲ -οτέρας κράσεως
			δέοιντο</span> if they want the oil-bath <i>hotter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.37.12
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλιαρὸς εἶ καὶ οὔτε ζ. οὔτε ψυχρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					3.15
				</span></i>
			.</div>
